The files placed within this folder include figures that were created during data analysis but were not used within the paper 

Reasons files may not have been used include:
a) the figure was made before all three research papers were included in overall analysis (Pham et al. data was included in 2023), or when we were still analyzing landscape variables that we decided to exclude from the paper

b) The figure was created to see how different species groups compared, but were not intended to be publication standards

c) The figures were created and/or used for presentations rather than the final paper

d) These are older versions of figures intended to be used in the final paper, that were changed for various reasons

